      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. John Lee and his team at UC Berkeley developed the tolerance analysis method, which is crucial for the reconstruction project."</data>
      <data key="d5">"invention, collaboration"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, BERKELEY&quot;" target="&quot;JORDANIAN DEPARTMENT OF ANTIQUITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The University of California, Berkeley and the Jordanian Department of Antiquities collaborate on the reconstruction project, combining archaeological and technological expertise."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaborative effort, interdisciplinary research"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANCIENT TEMPLE&quot;" target="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Freeform surface mirrors are a key component in the ancient temple's design, and their analysis using the patented method ensured the accuracy of the reconstruction project."</data>
      <data key="d5">"component analysis, precision"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANCIENT TEMPLE&quot;" target="&quot;3D PRINTING&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"3D printing technology is used to recreate the intricate stonework and ornate details of the ancient temple during the reconstruction project."</data>
      <data key="d5">"technological application, precision"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;DESIGNERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Designers rely on the granularity of freeform surface mirrors to make informed decisions about resource allocation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"resource allocation, granularity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;MANUFACTURING RESOURCES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Manufacturing resources are allocated to ensure that the most critical areas of freeform surface mirrors receive necessary attention."</data>
      <data key="d5">"allocation, critical areas"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;RESEARCHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Researchers demonstrated the accuracy of their approach in predicting the optical performance of freeform surface mirrors."</data>
      <data key="d5">"validation, accuracy"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;LEADING SCIENTIFIC JOURNALS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Results of the research on freeform surface mirrors were published in leading scientific journals, highlighting their significance."</data>
      <data key="d5">"publication, significance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;OPTICAL SYSTEM DESIGN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The research on freeform surface mirrors falls within the broader field of optical system design, contributing to its advancement."</data>
      <data key="d5">"contribution, advancement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;GRANULARITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Granularity is a characteristic of the images that helps in making informed decisions about the allocation of resources for freeform surface mirrors."</data>
      <data key="d5">"granularity, allocation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;FREEFORM SURFACE MIRRORS&quot;" target="&quot;COMPLEX SURFACE IRREGULARITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Freeform surface mirrors are characterized by complex surface irregularities that require careful attention during manufacturing."</data>
      <data key="d5">"irregularities, manufacturing"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;IMAGE QUALITY&quot;" target="&quot;GRANULARITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Image quality is a critical factor in determining the granularity, which affects resource allocation decisions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"quality, granularity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0127</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RESEARCHERS&quot;" target="&quot;RIGOROUS EXPERIMENTS&quot;">
